---
description: Phone Trackpad rules (Flutter phone, Tauri desktop, UDP motion totals)
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` first.

- Phone is Flutter. Desktop is Tauri 2 on Windows and macOS. Input is `SendInput` or `CGEvent` only.
- Wire format is `docs/PROTOCOL.md`. Motion totals, not text and not absolute coordinates.
- A lost motion packet is recovered by the next total. Clicks go on TCP.
- No input without a paired session. Do not hide the connected state.
- Run `npm test` before finishing. Run the app's own tests once it exists.
